  "prefLabel": "Plc 1004.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1004.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish the fees for examinations that will be charged by the third party testing organization(s) with whom the office of professional licensure and certification (OPLC) has contracted to administer the exam(s).\n\nSource. #14244, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14377, eff 10-8-25, EXPIRES: 10-8-35",
